00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:01,920
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) She is a teacher.

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,920
She teaches third graders.

3
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:09,800
She says, Good morning every day.

4
